type: dataset
title: "Indie SaaS Teardowns Dataset"
abstract: >-
  An open editorial dataset of indie SaaS marketing analysis: funnel
  teardowns, pricing teardowns, head-to-head comparisons, named-competitor
  alternatives, and canonical category buckets. Every row is independently
  verifiable against a dated, attributed source page on unlocksaas.com.
